hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"24377","Harun narrated to us, Abdullah ibn Wahb narrated to us, Abu Sakhr informed me, from Abdullah ibn Mu'attib ibn Abi Burdah al-Zafari, from his father, from his grandfather, who said: I heard the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, saying: From al-Kahinayn emerges a man who studies the Quran a study none after him studies."
